{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2022-08-30 10:09:00', 'title': 'PPG EARNS PRESTIGIOUS R&D 100 AWARDS FOR ANTIMICROBIAL, ANTIVIRAL PAINTS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT TWO OF ITS INDUSTRY-LEADING ANTIMICROBIAL AND ANTIVIRAL PRODUCTS HAVE BEEN RECOGNIZED WITH 2022 R&D® 100 AWARDS IN THE MECHANICAL/MATERIALS CATEGORY – COPPER ARMORTM ANTIMICROBIAL PAINT BY PPG WITH CORNING® GUARDIANT® TECHNOLOGY AND COMEX® VINIMEX® TOTAL ANTIVIRAL AND ANTIBACTERIAL PAINT. “AT PPG, OUR TEAMS ARE ALWAYS LOOKING FOR NEW AND INNOVATIVE WAYS TO ADDRESS OUR CUSTOMERS' BIGGEST CHALLENGES,” SAID DAVID BEM, PPG VICE PR"}